rn The created {@link FailableStream}.\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:582:     * Tests a predicate and rethrows any exception as a {@link RuntimeException}.\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:584:     * @param predicate the predicate to test\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:585:     * @param object1 the first input to test by {@code predicate}\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:586:     * @param object2 the second input to test by {@code predicate}\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:587:     * @param <T> the type of the first argument the predicate tests\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:588:     * @param <U> the type of the second argument the predicate tests\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:589:     * @param <E> the type of checked exception the predicate may throw\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:590:     * @return the boolean value returned by the predicate\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:598:     * Tests a predicate and rethrows any exception as a {@link RuntimeException}.\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:600:     * @param predicate the predicate to test\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:601:     * @param object the input to test by {@code predicate}\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:602:     * @param <T> the type of argument the predicate tests\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:603:     * @param <E> the type of checked exception the predicate may throw\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:604:     * @return the boolean value returned by the predicate\nsrc/main/java/org/apache/commons/lang3/function/Failable.java:612:     * {@link AutoCloseable} interface. The