e to consume.\n     * @return the NOP Consumer singleton.\n     */\n    @SuppressWarnings(\"unchecked\")\n    public static <T> Consumer<T> nop() {\n        return NOP;\n    }\n\n    private Consumers() {\n        // No instances.\n    }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
